    "background_story": "Alan was a talented writer who had once been full of life and creativity. However, after a painful breakup and a string of rejections from publishers, he found himself succumbing to listlessness. He would spend days lounging on the couch, unable to muster the energy to write or even leave the house. His apartment became a mess, with piles of unwashed dishes and unopened mail. Alan's friends and family tried to intervene, but he just couldn't shake off the feeling of emptiness and hopelessness. As the months dragged on, his passion for writing seemed to fade away, replaced by a dull sense of apathy. It wasn't until he met a kind stranger who shared his love for literature that Alan began to slowly find his way out of the darkness, rediscovering his voice and his purpose.",
